    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Acum 10.000 de ani, \u00een Orientul apropiat, omul a domesticit primele oi. \u0218i a plecat cu ele la drum. A\u0219a \u00eei spun ciobanii transhuman\u0163ei. Ceasul transhuman\u021bei se opre\u0219te cu fiecare familie de ciobani care alege s\u0103 nu mai mearg\u0103 la drum. Dar continu\u0103 s\u0103 bat\u0103 cu \u00eenc\u0103p\u0103\u0163\u00e2narea celor care \u00eenc\u0103 mai dorm printre oi sub cerul liber, cei care \u00eenc\u0103 tr\u0103iesc sub stele \u0219i care sunt din ce \u00een ce mai pu\u021bini. Ultima transhuman\u0163\u0103 este povestea lor.",
        "english": "Filmed in six countries during fifteen years , \"The Last Transhumance\" takes us into the world of shepherds who walk with their animals very long distances in search for food: an ancient way of life not compatible with the modern world."
